  "description_original": "Izdaje se dvosoban neuseljivan luksuzno opremljen stan od 68 kvadrata u ulici 4. jula. Stan je pozicioniran u zgradi Signum hotela. Potpuno je namjesten i posjeduje smart sistem, kao i garazno mjesto i dvije velike terase. Stan se izdaje na duzi period uz obavezan ugovor na godinu dana, kao i prvu mjesecnu kiriju i depozit. U stanu nije dozvoljeno drzati kucne ljubimce.\n\nA brand-new, fully furnished two-bedroom luxury apartment (68 m²) is available for rent on 4. Jula Street, within the Signum Hotel building. The apartment features a smart home system, a private garage space, and two spacious terraces.\nIt is offered for long-term rental only, with a minimum one-year contract. The first month’s rent and a security deposit are required upon signing. Pets are not allowed.",
